  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Above Blood Plain, Chu Du hands Nian Er Ping Zhi’s battle to a black robed Gu Immortal behind him. She has a hunched back, holds a walking stick, and has been silent. Bony hands lift her hood and she flies out, staring at the young Nian Er Ping Zhi. Righteous path voices name her the rank seven demonic Gu Immortal Granny Yin and call Chu Du shameless for sending a higher rank expert against a rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        1195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_blood_plain",
        "char_chu_du",
        "char_nian_er_ping_zhi",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a hunched back and holds a walking stick. Terrifyingly bony hands stretch from wide sleeves, and under the hood she has an old, crooked face with turbid yellow eyes. In battle she opens her mouth wide, revealing sparse yellow teeth, and her hand enlarges with dark wind around five fingers and nails sharp as needles.",
      "chapters": [
        1195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a veteran demonic path Gu Immortal who cultivates soul path and possesses bewitching soul Immortal Gu. She moves like a ghost among gloomy winds and vengeful souls, dictating the flow against Nian Er Ping Zhi’s sword light. She uses immortal killer move Bewitching Soul Art, then closes to crush his skull, but his sword light returns and cuts her into two as she falls with an incredulous look.",
      "chapters": [
        1196
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
